# Arachne's Web-slinging {W} (CR 702.188a): after Bot1's Ornithopter attacks and is tapped, Arachne is cast in the second
# main phase for {W} from one Plains, returning the Ornithopter; the pool is empty right after paying (not {2}{W}).
# Bot1 chooses Artifact and looks at Bot2's hand. Her own tax then applies to her controller's artifact: recasting the
# Ornithopter costs {1}, so one Plains pays it exactly.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Plains
Ornithopter
Arachne, Psionic Weaver
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {W}
Bot1.Hand.Arachne, Psionic Weaver.Cast(Ability: Web-slinging)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Name(Artifact)
? Bot1.Mana = 
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains#2.Activate
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Mana = 
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

